{"4589910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Toxic Corp", "steam_appid": 4589910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you earn a 5-star review?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a 90’s mall print shop where everything is falling apart—and you’re the one expected to hold it together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your boss is missing.<br>Your customers are unbearable.<br>The machines barely work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And somehow, it’s still your fault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589910/extras/63cd41ad71418b5db1b06050e5559344.poster.avif?t=1777388713\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589910/extras/63cd41ad71418b5db1b06050e5559344.webm?t=1777388713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589910/extras/63cd41ad71418b5db1b06050e5559344.mp4?t=1777388713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock in this <strong>arcade-style simulator</strong> where every order counts. Manage printers, restock supplies, and juggle nonstop demands while keeping customers just happy enough to leave a good review.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better you perform, the faster it all breaks down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589910/extras/381acbc91ef1a3cf64411f3298c95c2b.poster.avif?t=1777388713\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589910/extras/381acbc91ef1a3cf64411f3298c95c2b.webm?t=1777388713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589910/extras/381acbc91ef1a3cf64411f3298c95c2b.mp4?t=1777388713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade-Simulator Gameplay</strong> – Fast, repeatable runs where your <i>review score is your performance</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customer Chaos System</strong> – From confused to aggressive, every interaction adds pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hands-On Task Management</strong> – Print, refill, sort, and scramble to keep up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Difficulty</strong> – Success makes your job harder, not easier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satirical Tone</strong> – A not-so-loving tribute to terrible jobs and worse management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>90’s Mall Vibe</strong> – Analog machines, clunky systems, no hand-holding</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589910/extras/a58c437a464371f576a24dc861dde730.poster.avif?t=1777388713\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589910/extras/a58c437a464371f576a24dc861dde730.webm?t=1777388713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589910/extras/a58c437a464371f576a24dc861dde730.mp4?t=1777388713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589910/extras/061254bd54968b9abd520fea9d39987a.poster.avif?t=1777388713\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589910/extras/061254bd54968b9abd520fea9d39987a.webm?t=1777388713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589910/extras/061254bd54968b9abd520fea9d39987a.mp4?t=1777388713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How Long Can You Last?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no perfect runs—only better ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push for that 5-star review…<br>or watch it slip away one angry customer at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you earn a 5-star review?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a 90’s mall print shop where everything is falling apart—and you’re the one expected to hold it together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your boss is missing.<br>Your customers are unbearable.<br>The machines barely work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And somehow, it’s still your fault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589910/extras/63cd41ad71418b5db1b06050e5559344.poster.avif?t=1777388713\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589910/extras/63cd41ad71418b5db1b06050e5559344.webm?t=1777388713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589910/extras/63cd41ad71418b5db1b06050e5559344.mp4?t=1777388713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock in this <strong>arcade-style simulator</strong> where every order counts. Manage printers, restock supplies, and juggle nonstop demands while keeping customers just happy enough to leave a good review.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better you perform, the faster it all breaks down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589910/extras/381acbc91ef1a3cf64411f3298c95c2b.poster.avif?t=1777388713\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589910/extras/381acbc91ef1a3cf64411f3298c95c2b.webm?t=1777388713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4589910/extras/381acbc91ef1a3cf64411f3298c95c2b.mp4?t=1777388713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade-Simulator Gameplay</strong> – Fast, repeatable runs where your <i>review score is your performance</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customer Chaos System</strong> – From confused to aggressive, every interaction adds pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hands-On Task Management</strong> – Print, refill, sort, and scramble to keep up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Difficulty</strong> – Success makes your job harder, not easier</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satirical Tone</strong> – A not-so-loving tribute to terrible jobs and worse management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>90’s Mall Vibe</strong> – Analog machines, clunky systems, no hand-holding</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_im